{"id":"n64381-1-8","stage":5,"title":"성수기 · 旺季","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64381-1-8-1","ko":"제주도에 가는 비행기 표가 매진되었다며?","zh":"听说去济州岛的机票已经卖光了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제주도에","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"제주도에","audio":"/audio/a56332c57b721e11f8a6.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비행기","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"표가","meaning":"票，券","explanation":"표：票，券；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71353","senseId":"1","lemma":"표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"매진되었다며?","meaning":"售罄，脱销，卖光","explanation":"매진되다：售罄，脱销，卖光；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"매진되다","audio":"/audio/fd877830c58460355076.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55732","senseId":"1","lemma":"매진되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"3cb2c44c3b680b22","term":"비행기","zh":"飞机","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3","entryId":"15679","definition":"载着人或东西在空中飞行的交通工具。","pronunciation":["비행기"]},{"id":"40ec1a2864faf2b4","term":"표","zh":"票，券","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3","entryId":"71353","definition":"证明具有某种权利的纸条。","pronunciation":["표"]},{"id":"fd877830c5846035","term":"매진되다","zh":"售罄，脱销，卖光","audio":"/audio/fd877830c58460355076.mp3","entryId":"55732","definition":"商品或票等被全部卖掉。","pronunciation":["매ː진되다","매ː진뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d917e4fe7b7e96669cff.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64381-1-8-2","ko":"응. 성수기라서 그런가 봐.","zh":"嗯，大概是旅游旺季的缘故吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"성수기라서","meaning":"旺季","explanation":"성수기：旺季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"성수기","audio":"/audio/872e252c8ac33147b751.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64381","senseId":"1","lemma":"성수기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런가","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ가：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"872e252c8ac33147","term":"성수기","zh":"旺季","audio":"/audio/872e252c8ac33147b751.mp3","entryId":"64381","definition":"买东西或利用服务的人很多的时期。","pronunciation":["성ː수기"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9114edaffae5be36840.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"dif